# What the image builds must not see.
#
# The build stages bind-mount the repository instead of copying it module by module, so this file
# is the only thing keeping the host's own build output and git history out of the build context.
# A stale target/ directory would otherwise be visible to Maven inside the container, which is how
# a build "succeeds" against classes nobody compiled from the current source.
target/
**/target/

.git/
.gitignore

# Secrets, and local tooling that no image needs.
.env
.idea/
*.iml
.claude/
